From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cappy Ishihara <cappy@cappuchino.xyz>
Subject: [PATCH] Align A523 PORT2CHN with the three-VI three-UI mixer topology

Encode VI0, VI1, VI2, UI0, UI1 and UI2 in the same order advertised by
the A523 mixer configuration. The previous copied value omitted VI2.

Signed-off-by: Cappy Ishihara <cappy@cappuchino.xyz>
---
--- a/drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/ccu-sun8i-de2.c
+++ b/drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/ccu-sun8i-de2.c
@@ -310,7 +310,8 @@
 	if (of_device_is_compatible(pdev->dev.of_node,
 				    "allwinner,sun55i-a523-de33-clk")) {
 		writel(0, reg + 0x24);
-		writel(0x000a9810, reg + 0x28);
+		/* Logical ports: VI0, VI1, VI2, UI0, UI1, UI2. */
+		writel(0x00a98210, reg + 0x28);
 		de2tcon_mux = readl(reg + 0x10);
 		de2tcon_mux &= ~0xf;
 		de2tcon_mux |= 1;
